жидание двигает мок-часы на `timeout` секунд.\"\"\"\n96|\n97|    def __init__(self, clock: _FakeClock, empty_ticks: int, events: list) -> None:\n98|        self.clock = clock\n99|        self.empty_ticks = empty_ticks\n(more lines below)","correlation_facts":{"tool_name":"read_file","outcome":"success"}}}
